# Vouched contributors for Katharsis.
#
# Only vouched users can open pull requests. A pull request from anyone
# else is closed by .github/workflows/pr-policy.yml with the message in
# .github/vouch-pr-response.md.
#
# A repo collaborator vouches for a contributor by commenting "!vouch"
# on an issue that contributor authored. The comment opens a pull
# request that edits this file, and a maintainer merges it.
#
# Syntax:
#  - One handle per line (without @), sorted alphabetically.
#  - Prefix with minus to denounce: -username
#  - Add details after a space: -username reason
dependabot[bot]
holdenhewett
Open-Scribbler
